{"3017820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dangerous Connections", "steam_appid": 3017820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1987.</strong> The Soviet Union is no longer stable. Power shifts quietly beneath the surface, and not every faction follows the same path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the role of American special agent <strong>Dan Morris</strong>, known as “The Moscow Mule” — a field operative experienced in working behind the Iron Curtain. What begins as a covert investigation soon reveals a deeper struggle within a fractured system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Connections</strong> is a story-driven Cold War FPS that blends classic 90s-inspired design with modern sandbox elements. Rather than guiding you step by step, the game encourages exploration, observation, and independent decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/2f63bd559840c259651dd5ecb0c2de53.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/2f63bd559840c259651dd5ecb0c2de53.avif?t=1787680844 width=800 height=800 /></span><i>Secret Agent <strong>Dan Morris</strong> aka <strong>&quot;The Moscow Mule&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore a Divided World</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 15 handcrafted levels set in fictional Soviet locations, you will traverse snowy landscapes, industrial complexes, military installations, and hidden facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move on foot or take control of a wide range of custom <strong>Soviet-era vehicles</strong> — each built with attention to authenticity, wear, and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/26b9566f52738e8bebd0c046d0e491be.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/26b9566f52738e8bebd0c046d0e491be.avif?t=1787680844 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Snowy landscapes, industrial areas and enemy hideouts: Discover those and more in Dangerous Connections. Either by foot or with one of the many custom Soviet-era vehicles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Weapons, Vehicles, Freedom</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip period-accurate weapons or operate vehicles directly. Objectives can be approached in multiple ways, with minimal guidance and limited assistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/ee4c282f877436dea47c4c7cfe03b67b.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/ee4c282f877436dea47c4c7cfe03b67b.avif?t=1787680844 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Custom-made vehicles from Soviet production in various shapes, colors and signs of wear and tear.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/f3cc9b985652821a44ac6384d179d42c.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/f3cc9b985652821a44ac6384d179d42c.avif?t=1787680844 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One of your few digital tools: the <strong>FieldPad</strong> — your connection to mission data and operational insights.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Inspired by the Classics</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Connections draws inspiration from 90s console and PC FPS titles, embracing their strengths while enhancing them with modern technical capabilities and open-ended level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Familiar faces</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game pays tribute to industry legends who shaped a generation of players. Among them, Dr. David Doak returns in a special appearance, reprising his iconic role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/4318520efd3b62dc2513b9ac82744751.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/4318520efd3b62dc2513b9ac82744751.avif?t=1787680844 width=800 height=618 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dangerous Connections features a host of familiar faces from gaming history, like <strong>Dr. David Doak</strong> reprising his role as the famous Dr. Doak.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Synopsis</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligence reports indicate the development of an experimental weapon of mass destruction within the Soviet Union — a device unlike anything previously documented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its intended use is unclear. Its consequences could be catastrophic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the situation is more complex than a simple rogue operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prevent geopolitical disaster, you must move carefully, act decisively, and uncover the forces operating behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because sometimes the greatest threat is not an enemy across borders — but divisions within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/3d3fb1b045c9dd1ba9ba94df0d6e4d87.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/3d3fb1b045c9dd1ba9ba94df0d6e4d87.avif?t=1787680844 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1987.</strong> The Soviet Union is no longer stable. Power shifts quietly beneath the surface, and not every faction follows the same path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the role of American special agent <strong>Dan Morris</strong>, known as “The Moscow Mule” — a field operative experienced in working behind the Iron Curtain. What begins as a covert investigation soon reveals a deeper struggle within a fractured system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Connections</strong> is a story-driven Cold War FPS that blends classic 90s-inspired design with modern sandbox elements. Rather than guiding you step by step, the game encourages exploration, observation, and independent decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/2f63bd559840c259651dd5ecb0c2de53.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/2f63bd559840c259651dd5ecb0c2de53.avif?t=1787680844 width=800 height=800 /></span><i>Secret Agent <strong>Dan Morris</strong> aka <strong>&quot;The Moscow Mule&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore a Divided World</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 15 handcrafted levels set in fictional Soviet locations, you will traverse snowy landscapes, industrial complexes, military installations, and hidden facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move on foot or take control of a wide range of custom <strong>Soviet-era vehicles</strong> — each built with attention to authenticity, wear, and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/26b9566f52738e8bebd0c046d0e491be.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/26b9566f52738e8bebd0c046d0e491be.avif?t=1787680844 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Snowy landscapes, industrial areas and enemy hideouts: Discover those and more in Dangerous Connections. Either by foot or with one of the many custom Soviet-era vehicles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Weapons, Vehicles, Freedom</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip period-accurate weapons or operate vehicles directly. Objectives can be approached in multiple ways, with minimal guidance and limited assistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/ee4c282f877436dea47c4c7cfe03b67b.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/ee4c282f877436dea47c4c7cfe03b67b.avif?t=1787680844 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Custom-made vehicles from Soviet production in various shapes, colors and signs of wear and tear.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/f3cc9b985652821a44ac6384d179d42c.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/f3cc9b985652821a44ac6384d179d42c.avif?t=1787680844 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One of your few digital tools: the <strong>FieldPad</strong> — your connection to mission data and operational insights.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Inspired by the Classics</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Connections draws inspiration from 90s console and PC FPS titles, embracing their strengths while enhancing them with modern technical capabilities and open-ended level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Familiar faces</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game pays tribute to industry legends who shaped a generation of players. Among them, Dr. David Doak returns in a special appearance, reprising his iconic role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/4318520efd3b62dc2513b9ac82744751.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/4318520efd3b62dc2513b9ac82744751.avif?t=1787680844 width=800 height=618 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dangerous Connections features a host of familiar faces from gaming history, like <strong>Dr. David Doak</strong> reprising his role as the famous Dr. Doak.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Synopsis</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligence reports indicate the development of an experimental weapon of mass destruction within the Soviet Union — a device unlike anything previously documented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its intended use is unclear. Its consequences could be catastrophic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the situation is more complex than a simple rogue operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prevent geopolitical disaster, you must move carefully, act decisively, and uncover the forces operating behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because sometimes the greatest threat is not an enemy across borders — but divisions within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras/3d3fb1b045c9dd1ba9ba94df0d6e4d87.avif?t=1787680844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/extras_big/3d3fb1b045c9dd1ba9ba94df0d6e4d87.avif?t=1787680844 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "short_description": "1987. The Soviet Union is cracking from within. As special agent Dan Morris, navigate a world of shifting loyalties, covert operations, and ideological fractures in this story-driven Cold War FPS.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/a7e5bc115bd781b21f0f3ac8b648a94449124ba0/header.jpg?t=1787680844", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/bd1cc7bac402c711b40264a94fca049e3b4bcc68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787680844", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017820/bd1cc7bac402c711b40264a94fca049e3b4bcc68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787680844", "website": "https://www.dangerous-connections.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX11 compatible graphics card with 2 GB memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas